This package bundles a build of Pixel Agents at publish time.
Pixel Agents is available under the MIT License. Its upstream license is
included in the published tarball at `vendor/pixel-agents/LICENSE`.

The bundled office assets ship with Pixel Agents under that same MIT License.
Its character sprites are based on the MetroCity Free Topdown Character Pack by
JIK-A-4, released under Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0), which places
them in the public domain. CC0 requires no attribution; this credit is given
because the author asked for it to be appreciated rather than required.
https://jik-a-4.itch.io/metrocity-free-topdown-character-pack
